+# Runbook
+
+## Configuration
+
+The service reads `process.env.PORT`, `process.env.DATABASE_URL`, `process.env.LOG_LEVEL`,
+`process.env.SMTP_HOST`, `process.env.SMTP_FROM` and `process.env.INVOICE_PREFIX` in `src/config/settings.ts`.
+A cache would need `process.env.REDIS_URL`; it is not wired yet.
+
+## Database
+
+`src/infra/db/pool.ts` opens a `pg` pool of ten connections. Restart the service after a failover.
